                        2964 --1505:  * Sequence is:

                                                                      Page 51
                                                              C:\Users\a5152492\AppData\Local\Temp\gh_0000tvs1.s
                        2965 --1506:  * - Switch on BFA
                        2966 --1507:  * - Copy code to FCU
                        2967 --1508:  * - Switch off BFA
                        2968 --1509:  * - Clear Cache
                        2969 --1510:  * The cache clear check loop is timeout supervised
                        2970 --1511:  *
                        2971 --1512:  * Note: the code for GHS, IAR and CC-RL is basically equal, only the style is compiler dependent and so, different.
                        2972 --1513:  *       GHS code is fully commented, while the IAR and CC-RL code is partly or not commented. Refer to GHS comments
                        2973 --1514:  *       to understand the code.
                        2974 --1515:  *
                        2975 --1516: * @param[in]  param_pu32 - Parameter array containing addresses and data for the assembler
                        2976 --1517:  *                          function
